    "updated_at": "2026-11-06T23:49:45Z",
    "body": "Cause (still current at 64a5708): for Pocket / 2D Adaptive / 2D Offset with an Entity (whole part) source, `source_region` (operation/material_source.rs) returns the part's own section at Top Z and the pocket generator hollows its inside - i.e. it machines the part. Only picked selections got the M11.4 island law (`pocket_region_on_part`). Fix in progress at the region law (operation/area.rs): a whole-part source with a setup stock clears the stock outline minus every part section standing at the ladder planes (islands), and refuses by name when the part fills the stock outline. Stock source / no stock keep the documented 'volume to remove' reading.",
